Note that fountains have a higher chance of granting wishes on upper
levels than lower, so you may want to consider dipping for Excalibur
on lower levels if that's a concern (maybe start at Oracle and go
down)--for instance, a character who lacks MR and wants to make sure
they can deal with bad fountain consequences and then try dipping for
wishes to get it before descending.



